{"id": "b10_047", "text": "no agnosia, recognizes the arm and knows something's wrong", "by": "medic", "speaker": null, "facts": [["exam.race.aphasia_agnosia", 0, "medic", null]], "phenomena": ["negation", "asr_noise"]}
{"id": "b10_048", "text": "Doesn't recognize the arm, and says nothing's wrong with her.", "by": "medic", "speaker": null, "facts": [["exam.race.aphasia_agnosia", 2, "medic", null], ["stroke.deficits", ["doesn't recognize the arm", "says nothing's wrong with her"], "medic", null]], "phenomena": ["clean"]}
{"id": "b10_049", "text": "Garbled speech.", "by": "medic", "speaker": null, "facts": [["exam.gfast.speech", 1, "medic", null], ["stroke.deficits", ["garbled speech"], "medic", null]], "phenomena": ["clean"]}
{"id": "b10_050", "text": "word finding difficulty but he understands everything I ask", "by": "medic", "speaker": null, "facts": [["exam.gfast.speech", 1, "medic", null], ["stroke.deficits", ["word finding difficulty"], "medic", null]], "phenomena": ["asr_noise"]}
{"id": "b10_051", "text": "speech clear", "by": "medic", "speaker": null, "facts": [["exam.gfast.speech", 0, "medic", null]], "phenomena": ["negation", "asr_noise"]}
{"id": "b10_052", "text": "She knows it's her arm and she's aware of the weakness, so agnosia zero.", "by": "medic", "speaker": null, "facts": [["exam.race.aphasia_agnosia", 0, "medic", null]], "phenomena": ["clean", "spoken_numbers"]}
